{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.IntervalCases"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.degreeBound_lt_of_four_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.degreeBound_lt_of_four_lt","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L71-L79","doc":"Above `A = 4` the pair count strictly exceeds the degree bound, so the\ncoordination weight and the wall-excess reading diverge and keep diverging. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.pairCount_lt_of_lt_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.pairCount_lt_of_lt_four","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L66-L69","doc":"Below `A = 4` the pair count is strictly smaller than the degree bound. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.eq_iff_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.eq_iff_four","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L48-L64","doc":"**The coincidence is unique.** For `2 ≤ A`, the doubled pair count equals\nthe doubled degree bound exactly when `A = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.degreeBound_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.degreeBound_four","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L44-L46","doc":"The degree bound at `A = 4` is `6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.pairCount_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.pairCount_four","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L40-L42","doc":"The pair count at `A = 4` is `6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.coincide_at_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.coincide_at_four","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L35-L38","doc":"At `A = 4` the two coincide: both pair count and degree bound are `6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.twiceDegreeBound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.twiceDegreeBound","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L32-L33","doc":"Doubled degree bound, so the two are compared in the same units. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.twicePairCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.twicePairCount","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L29-L30","doc":"Doubled pair count `2 * C(A,2) = A * (A - 1)`, division-free. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.degreeBound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.degreeBound","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PairCountMeetsDegreeBoundAtFour.lean#L26-L27","doc":"Regular simple-graph degree bound on the binding ratio at mass number `A`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}